&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Advanced Race Guide, Elves of Golarion, Gnomes of Golarion, Goblins of Golarion, Halflings of Golarion, Humans of Golarion, Dwarves of Golarion, Orcs of Golarion/Manuel des races&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoMR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;L’homme-f&#233;lin est n&#233; pour charger ses ennemis et personne ne le fait aussi bien que lui.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cat&#233;gorie.&lt;/b&gt; combat&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Conditions.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Homme-F&#233;lin-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les hommes-f&#233;lins&quot;&gt;homme-f&#233;lin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Caract&#233;ristiques#Dexterite.html&quot; title=&quot;La Dext&#233;rit&#233;&quot;&gt;Dex&lt;/a&gt; 13, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Vocabulaire-Courant#Bonusdebasealattaque.html&quot; title=&quot;BBA&quot;&gt;BBA&lt;/a&gt;+1, trait racial sprinter&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Avantages.&lt;/b&gt; L’homme-f&#233;lin ne re&#231;oit pas de malus de -2 &#224; la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Valeurs-De-Combat#Ca.html&quot; title=&quot;CA&quot;&gt;CA&lt;/a&gt; quand il utilise le don &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Encha&#238;nement.html&quot; title=&quot;Encha&#238;nement&quot;&gt;Encha&#238;nement&lt;/a&gt;, le don &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Fente.html&quot; title=&quot;Fente&quot;&gt;Fente&lt;/a&gt; ou quand il charge.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Pathfinder unchained (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Pathfinder unchained&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoPU.png&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;separator&quot;&gt;Astuce martiale (&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Endurance-Et-Astuces-Martiales.html&quot; title=&quot;Endurance et Astuces martiales&quot;&gt;r&#232;gles&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;a class=&quot;headeranchor&quot; id=&quot;Astuce_martiale__r&#232;gles__0&quot; href=&quot;#Astuce_martiale__r&#232;gles__0&quot; title=&quot;Link to this Section&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Quand le personnage utilise le don &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Encha&#238;nement.html&quot; title=&quot;Encha&#238;nement&quot;&gt;Encha&#238;nement&lt;/a&gt; ou &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Fente.html&quot; title=&quot;Fente&quot;&gt;Fente&lt;/a&gt;, ou quand il &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Sp&#233;ciales#Charge.html&quot; title=&quot;charge&quot;&gt;charge&lt;/a&gt;, il peut d&#233;penser 5 points d’endurance pour gagner un bonus d’esquive de +2 &#224; la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Valeurs-De-Combat#Ca.html&quot; title=&quot;CA&quot;&gt;CA&lt;/a&gt;. Ce bonus persiste jusqu’au d&#233;but de son prochain tour.
